    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Deathwatch Corvus Blackstar" hidden="false" id="4902-d863-d129-6744" collective="false">
      <comment>Base 142 from vehicle design rules. Round down to 140 for simplicity.</comment>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Ceramite Shielding" id="2bf5-9c38-83ad-3a24" hidden="false">
          <description>The Blackstar&apos;s reentry shielding makes it resistant to melta weapons. Melta weapons, including melta bombs, never roll a extra dice for armour penetration due to being at half range against a Blackstar.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
